# Local env files: never commit API keys, tokens, or user secrets.
*.env
!.mac-release.env
api.env*

# The vendored NeMo Relay tree ships source under directories named `bin/`
# (the plugin host and the ledger fixtures) and one toolchain pin named
# `*.env`. Without these negations the rules above swallow that source
# silently — which is how five restored files lived in the working tree but
# never in git, leaving the declared runtime identity unreproducible from a
# clone. The transfer manifest's digest covers the working tree, so the gate
# passed while git did not have them; a fresh clone recomputes a different
# tree and fails closed.
!runtimes/nemo-relay/**/bin/
!runtimes/nemo-relay/**/bin/**
!runtimes/nemo-relay/.github/*.env

# Local planning artifacts from $prepare-plans / $prepare-plans-goals.
# These are scratch inputs for the current session, not part of the repo.
PLAN*.md
plan*.md

# Swift VM daemon build outputs
vmd/.build/
internal/applevmhelper/embedded/
/crabbox-apple-vm-helper
/crabbox-apple-vm-vmd
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.claude/
nemo/node_modules/
release-evidence/

# Vite/Vitest local cache (not source)
.vite/
